# Weight profile ornith-1.5-122b-exl3-4.0: Ornith-1.5-122B (MIT) in our EXL3 pack at 4.0 bpw: every projection at 4 bits, head 6,
# MTP layer 4, vision tower 6 (exllamav3 1.6.2, mul1 codebook; 64.6 GB), converted from ornith-ai/Ornith-1.5-122B at
# revision e09bc0dfbe. In the converter's own check against BF16 (100 rows x 2,048): KL 0.093, top-1 87.9 %, ppl 7.007
# against 7.003. Measured on the Spark (2026-10-20): 61.2 GiB allocated at load, plain decode 39.0 tok/s.
# Switch with ops/use-profile.sh ornith-1.5-122b-exl3-4.0.
QSE_ORN_VARIANT=exl3-4.0
QSE_WEIGHTS_HF=0xBakeer/TandemLLM-Ornith-1.5-122B-EXL3-4.0
QSE_WEIGHTS_REVISION=9e73dddc081cc178408bdb79025d7fcbca1ffd6c
QSE_WEIGHTS_GB=64.6
# MemAvailable (GiB) a start needs: the weights (61.2 allocated), the engine and its graphs, the KV at 262,144 tokens,
# the allocator, the prefill workspace and the 15 GiB floor
QSE_MEM_NEED_GIB=92
# the engine's limits: the weights (61.2) + the runtime (an estimate of 4) + the KV at 262,144 tokens (6.5) + the vision
# tower and its image cache (1); peak: the ceiling + the prefill workspace (an estimate of 4)
MEM_CEILING_GIB=73
MEM_PEAK_GIB=77
. "${REPO}/ops/profiles/_ornith.env"
